  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Exquisite Custom-built home in the prestigious gated community of WaterSound Beach! This amazing home has 5 en-suite bedrooms total - 4 in the Main House and an additional bedroom in the carriage house. The Main House also has an 3 story elevator & all encompassing Gulf views from the Tower. This home's Private Pool can be heated for an additional fee of only $45 per day ($180 minimum). The list of custom features are endless and designed to maximize the special indoor/outdoor connection of this home. Inside, the interior spaces include incredible finishes throughout such as walnut floors, marble and granite countertops, custom wood moldings, 200-year-old reclaimed beams, plus Sub Zero & Wolf appliances. Outside, there are two amazing 8' rain walls dramatically splashing 10' down into an over-sized square pool, along with numerous spacious porches where you can relax. The Main House has 2 fully equipped kitchens plus a 3rd kitchen in Carriage Home, perfect for large families.<br><br>This beachfront community boasts a network of winding, wooden boardwalks, bridges and trails that connect the community’s homes, cottages and condominiums, offering picture-perfect views of a largely untouched and uncrowded stretch of white-sand beach. The rare Coastal Lake of Camp Creek allows for kayaking, boating, yolo boarding, and long walks on many scenic winding boardwalks.<br><br>Activities are abundant all along Scenic Hwy 30-A and South Walton. Eclectic shops, unique galleries, and award - winning dining are all a part of the area's distinct character. Outdoor activities are abundant within the four state parks, a state forest, 15 rare coastal dune lakes and the Gulf of Mexico. If boating & fishing are your passion - this region offers some of the best! The beautiful Gulf of Mexico, the area's 17 freshwater and saltwater lakes, Choctawhatchee Bay, West Bay and St. Andrews Bay provide unmatched opportunities for fishing and water sports. Bay Point Marina in Panama City Beach offers fishing, boating, jet skiing, swimming, sailing, snorkeling and off-shore charter boats.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Private Heated Pool - opt. - Amazing Gulf Views, Golf Cart Included, sleeps 10"
        }
      ],
